  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "2026-11-12 (trigger lane): 'When you do' is a reflexive trigger (CR 603.12): Seq(OptionalEffect(SACRIFICE), Conditional(MAY_DONE, DelayedTrigger(duration=None, event=None, ...))). Its target is chosen as it goes on the stack, after the sacrifice; before, it was chosen as the enters trigger went on the stack, so with no opposing creature you could not sacrifice at all. The record's ir and draft changed with it; its verified stamp (if any) no longer matches, so it is verified again before it is dealt."
